	"Name": "Starr's Pokegoods Update",
	"Author": "EmeraldStarr121",
	"Description": "This uses Content Patcher and Json Assets to add Pokemon themed food and items from the various games and cartoon. Medoli900's Pokecrops (I highly recommend with and without my mod) is required for the food pack, but the stone pack alone can be used without it. Honestly, their Oran berries inspired me....\n<br />\n<br />Also, (DGA) PPJAs More Trees and (DGA) Artisan Valley Machine Goods is recommended (and probably needed) too.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />This is my first ever Mod, and from what I tested, its compatible with SDVE, Ridgeside, East Scarpe, Pokefy, Pokemania!\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />All artwork (besides the header) I post is mine and was made by me on Aseprite.\n<br />\n<br />I'll probably update to better fix the rarity of the stones, and the food's price and effects.\n<br />\n<br />You should receive mail from your old Aunt Delia, and some other characters from the vanilla game too.",
